# Project Intelligence Report: Psyichub v2

## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

Psyichub is an advanced, hybrid AI-powered clinical decision-support platform built to automate the analysis of complex psychometric assessments (starting with the Narrative Intelligence Test/TAT). Operating on a B2B2C and B2B SaaS model, the platform provides mental health clinics, independent psychologists, and organizations with a credit-based system to conduct multi-modal assessments, automatically generate 8-dimension PDF clinical profiles, and maintain patient session histories securely. By leveraging a complex 11-engine AI pipeline (NLP, Vision, and RAG), Psyichub significantly reduces clinical evaluation time while enforcing rigorous data security and role-based access controls.

