## TECHNICAL DEBT REPORT

| Level | Finding | Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Critical** | Synchronous ML Inference | Running deep learning models directly in the FastAPI request cycle will lead to severe timeout issues under load. |
| **High** | Monolithic Background Jobs | The `sla_task` loop running inside Uvicorn's lifespan makes horizontal pod scaling dangerous (race conditions). |
| **Medium** | Audit Log Bloat | `audit_logs` table lacks partitioning or a data retention policy. |
| **Low** | File Upload Handling | Local filesystem usage for `SESSION_DIR` will break in a multi-server/Kubernetes deployment. |

